 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ (lane kit-batch-2005-20261121), hand-read: panel 14 (Hoofdweg, E, 83 m) from w01-72 2020-02-07: four brick towers at 12.8-20.8, 33.6-42.7, 55.8-63.7 and 77.9-83.4 m along the panel, each blank but for one window column at its right edge, between low parts of five window columns; six window storeys over a ground storey about 1.6 upper storeys tall with shop windows in a pale stone plinth; the top storey is the crenellated parapet zone, drawn blank (the crenellations are not modelled). Panel 34 (N, 43.5 m) from w04-342 2025-06-17: six storeys of paired windows over a pilotis ground, small attic slot windows between the merlons.",
  "Not modelled: the crenellated parapet (merlons and gaps), the north pilotis columns and open undercroft (drawn as a blank ground storey), the shop fascias."
